# Two classes that no family holds meet at a place that is only constructed. If they were lost there, their class objects would count as open, their instances as escaped, and `o.k` as anything. The construction is a caller of each: new.target is the class itself, and what it gives is what the two give.
# RUN: link functions fields layouts mechanisms=all
# CHECK: function f1 callers-known {{*}}result=L0
# CHECK: function f2 callers-known {{*}}result=L1
# CHECK: field L0.0 "k" proven=i32 writers-known written-at-construction-alone
# CHECK: field L1.0 "k" proven=i32 writers-known written-at-construction-alone
# CHECK: layout L0 changes=[] stays-with-compiled-code
# CHECK: layout L1 changes=[] stays-with-compiled-code
# The construction has two callees: no row names one, and neither takes what a walk leaves at a call.
